WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 33h: Battle of the Gardens — full montage
Duration: ~79 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — exterior traversal, Rinoa rescue, ground combat

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Camera moves through the gap between the two locked Gardens, wreckage and beams framing green terrain below.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Close-up of a figure's shoulder armor against Balamb Garden's hull. Green plains stretch far below.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Galbadia Garden's red angular hull sweeps past, lit windows and panels, mountains in the distance.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Looking down between the two Gardens at green terrain far below. The height is dizzying.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Close-up of both hulls pressed together — Galbadia's pink-red panels against Balamb's teal dome.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Balamb Garden's golden harp-like ring structure from below, teal energy ring glowing, ground visible through the framework.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Camera races along structural beams. A small figure stands on a girder between the Gardens, silhouetted against the sky.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Close-up of Galbadia Garden's hull. A mech soldier clings to the edge above while Rinoa hangs from the rocky surface below, reaching desperately.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Close-up of Rinoa gripping a cable, dark hair streaming in the wind, blue tank top, terrified but holding on.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Overhead view of the battlefield below. Soldiers clash on churned earth around impact craters near the Gardens.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Ground-level combat along a curved walkway. SeeD cadets fight Galbadian soldiers hand to hand, smoke rising, planters smashed.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Chaotic melee on the Garden grounds. Dozens of fighters struggle across grass and dirt, fire and magic erupting, fallen soldiers everywhere.
